  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W2 \u2014 Recce booking \u00b7 Photo & video studio\n\n**Boundary: automated proposal, human confirm above CHF 2500.**\nA half day corporate shoot with a basic web licence lands around CHF 1,200-1,800, so a CHF 2,500 line catches full wedding packages, multi-day productions and anything carrying a broad usage licence - the work where a wrong number is expensive and hard to walk back (figure illustrative). Scored 3/2/4.\n\n### The measurable thing here is travel\nClustering by locality is the whole point. Travel minutes per shoot, before and after, is unambiguous and it converts directly to money \u2014 the easiest result in the whole project to defend.\n\nRecord the unclustered estimate too, or you have nothing to compare against. The **Cluster by locality** node writes both.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0bfe789b-7208-479f-9a38-d05336be2747",
